  offerText: Let me stare silently into your eyes for three hours to realign your
    aura. It's totally free. Your mind will be at peace and your stress will vanish.
  acceptResultText: It is incredibly awkward at first, but Greg's intense gaze actually
    cures your anxiety and lowers your blood pressure.
  rejectResultText: You walk away, but the crushing weight of your unresolved stress
    gives you a massive migraine.
